rs!</strong> Choose your battles strategically.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Custom hand-drawn art</strong>, including scene-based CGs and expressive character busts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Original soundtrack</strong> with a captivating, fairy-tale-like main theme.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Character interactions &amp; romances.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>English &amp; Polish language support.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf3f <strong>Fully voice-acted demo.</strong></p>",
